Subject: [PATCH 3/7] =?UTF-8?q?POC:=20pas=20de=20r=C3=A9paration=20de=20pr?=
 =?UTF-8?q?obe=20ni=20de=20scan=20copy-safety=20pour=20les=20versions=20St?=
 =?UTF-8?q?reamFusion?=
